      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但我比較喜歡\n「看穿」這個招式！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n因為「守住」雖然能守得比較久，\n但「看穿」比較容易連續使出！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŇ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F4662116BD48F03559C6B61000A300C770B7A7F300D9019500B62DB5F0FFF0100100001BE01000A56E070BA300C5B884F4F300D96D6713680FD5B885F976BD48F034E45FF0C000A4F46300C770B7A7F300D6BD48F035BB9661390237E8C4F7F51FAFF0100100002011401470000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
